# Local Dev Testing

Follow the full procedure defined in `../haderach-platform/.cursor/rules/local-dev-testing.mdc`.

This app runs on port **5177** and depends on:

- **agent service** (port 8080) — chat backend and CMS proxy endpoints (`/agent/api/cms/**`)
- **Payload CMS** (port 3000) — content read API (`/cms/api/**`), proxied via vite dev server

UI-only changes (styling, layout) can run in bypass mode (`VITE_AUTH_BYPASS=true`). Backend-dependent changes (auth, content fetching, write workflow) require real auth mode and the agent service.
